Package: bilbyr
Type: Package
Title: Diagnostic Tools for Projection Pursuit Indices
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Tina",
      "Rashid Jafari",
      email = "tina.rashidjafari@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides tools for investigating, diagnosing, and benchmarking
    candidate projection pursuit indices before and during their use in
    guided tours. The package supports exploration of signal and noise
    behaviour, null distributions, sample-size effects, index calibration,
    optimisation behaviour, and recovery of informative projections.
    Scagnostic indices are used as initial case studies.
